<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is holding multiple bilateral talks in Damascus on border security and refugee management with Lebanon and Jordan, while also discussing oil exports via the Banias pipeline with Iraq and considering joining a Saudi-Turkey-Pakistan defence pact. Iranian border guards clashed with smugglers near the KRI border, Israeli strikes hit southern Syria, and Syrian intelligence foiled a terrorist plot against the Homs refinery. Kurdish refugees from Sarkani report insecurity after an attack on a return convoy, and Syrian organisations are seeking justice for journalists killed under the former regime. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPV2dMa1VybnpsRlhYS0JmMEZkT1ZFNTVnaUNsM2x1WjE2OUNrX3RCWlZyTWNaZWM3Ql9hemZ0cFVaTG1wTnlCWS1ObEQ5VXF4cWhqTGNLak1PZEk3dlRDc0VrUzd2cW9Ga1ZJbnp4OFp4MXRkV2dNVFg5N0JvMFFyVEtCbUl2cjJmaXdaRTJDVDJRc3hMbFAySVU1cjRQWHY3MTQ3cDNrWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNcHVLTXUwSktyTGViU1lOZFpCcG9odU1wajlpcmhfNVJtMlhTTy1SVHlUVFR1dFNwV1VwZGpqTFpfemdlZVlfVDlQbWZIV1FyNDZsZVdrU0piSmt4QWFfODQxdE9vQTRFdXkwV21UQmZNVGdmX19pbnVtNHpnNmRZSTRSSGwwOHRtaFI2M2Zncm1EM00xZUROZFhoZDhqQzV5TkdPMW8zWDgwZndF?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOSmVUYk02SHZZWFg5NlhBbHdRaXhvTGZKNFVTVVZENFBNX2RkZWU4blp0VjNxQ0ttWVhKeURUTTdjQWxnWVFjblJpVWtxeXM4bldJbTI2ZWQyc0dqNzJOVkY2RlVxVlk0VnM1VTAzUDB6UVFRVFlBODQwXzB0eHloU1ZBOXB0MUJSRDhGdy0xajJVeTI0dGdmenI2YzdoSDVOMFpqbDR5dHVydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Arab Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;کردپرس&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOMFVuUVRraWlQUVZhSDBBbzM0S3